### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### Phase 1 Foundation — API Test Suite
### Sovva Backend (.NET 8)
###
### Usage: Install "REST Client" VS Code extension, then click
###        "Send Request" above each request block.
###
### Replace @adminToken and @userToken with real Supabase JWTs.
### Tokens expire after 1 hour — refresh via supabase.auth.getSession()
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5257
@adminToken = eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IjE4OTNiMDM2LWYyMTAtNDM4Ni1hNWJkLTk5ODA3N2FhOWYwNyIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..WGeKXQVoqbHwBu5wJtUdQ4Ap2EnuKsmQlly4c7uxYgzqk1y1NTWpZva49lnHvr3KVG_QkU8qyX0xKQxRjFtc6A
@userToken = eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IjE4OTNiMDM2LWYyMTAtNDM4Ni1hNWJkLTk5ODA3N2FhOWYwNyIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..WGeKXQVoqbHwBu5wJtUdQ4Ap2EnuKsmQlly4c7uxYgzqk1y1NTWpZva49lnHvr3KVG_QkU8qyX0xKQxRjFtc6A


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 1. INGREDIENT CATEGORIES
### Controller: IngredientCategoriesController
### Base route: /api/IngredientCategories
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ─── 1.1 GET all categories ──────────────────────────────────────
### Happy path — AllowAnonymous, no auth needed
### Expected: 200 OK → array of { categoryId, categoryName }

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/IngredientCategories HTTP/1.1

###

### ─── 1.2 GET category by ID ──────────────────────────────────────
### Happy path — AllowAnonymous
### Expected: 200 OK → { categoryId, categoryName }

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/IngredientCategories/1 HTTP/1.1

###

### ─── 1.3 GET category by ID — not found ──────────────────────────
### Expected: 404 Not Found

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/IngredientCategories/99999 HTTP/1.1

###

### ─── 1.4 POST create category — happy path ──────────────────────
### Admin only — requires Admin JWT
### Expected: 201 Created → Location header

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/IngredientCategories HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "categoryName": "Test Category"
}

###

### ─── 1.5 POST create category — no auth ─────────────────────────
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/IngredientCategories HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "categoryName": "Should Fail"
}

###

### ─── 1.6 POST create category — user token (not admin) ──────────
### Expected: 403 Forbidden (user role != Admin)

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/IngredientCategories HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "categoryName": "Should Fail"
}

###

### ─── 1.7 POST create category — invalid input ──────────────────
### Expected: 400 Bad Request (empty body)

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/IngredientCategories HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

###


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 2. INGREDIENTS
### Controller: IngredientsController
### Base route: /api/Ingredients
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ─── 2.1 GET all ingredients — happy path ────────────────────────
### Requires auth (any role)
### Expected: 200 OK → array of IngredientDto

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Ingredients HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###

### ─── 2.2 GET all ingredients — no auth ──────────────────────────
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Ingredients HTTP/1.1

###

### ─── 2.3 GET ingredients by category ─────────────────────────────
### Expected: 200 OK → filtered array

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Ingredients/category/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###

### ─── 2.4 GET ingredient by ID — happy path ──────────────────────
### Expected: 200 OK → single IngredientDto

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Ingredients/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###

### ─── 2.5 GET ingredient by ID — not found ───────────────────────
### Expected: 404 → { error: "Ingredient with ID 99999 not found" }

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Ingredients/99999 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###

### ─── 2.6 POST create ingredient — happy path ────────────────────
### Admin only
### Expected: 201 Created → { ingredientId, message }
### DTO: CreateIngredientDto { categoryId, ingredientName, price, available }

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Ingredients HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "categoryId": 1,
    "ingredientName": "Test Ingredient",
    "price": 25.50,
    "available": true
}

###

### ─── 2.7 POST create ingredient — no auth ───────────────────────
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Ingredients HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "categoryId": 1,
    "ingredientName": "Should Fail",
    "price": 10.00,
    "available": true
}

###

### ─── 2.8 POST create ingredient — user token (not admin) ────────
### Expected: 403 Forbidden

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Ingredients HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "categoryId": 1,
    "ingredientName": "Should Fail",
    "price": 10.00,
    "available": true
}

###

### ─── 2.9 POST create ingredient — invalid input ─────────────────
### Expected: 400 Bad Request (missing required fields)

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Ingredients HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "categoryId": 0,
    "ingredientName": "",
    "price": -5
}

###

### ─── 2.10 PATCH toggle availability — happy path ────────────────
### Admin only — toggles ingredient.Available between true/false
### Expected: 200 OK → { message, ingredientId, available }
### Replace {id} with a real ingredient ID

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/Ingredients/1/toggle-availability HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### ─── 2.11 PATCH toggle availability — no auth ──────────────────
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/Ingredients/1/toggle-availability HTTP/1.1

###

### ─── 2.12 PATCH toggle availability — not found ─────────────────
### Expected: 404 → { error: "Ingredient with ID 99999 not found" }

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/Ingredients/99999/toggle-availability HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 3. SERVICEABLE LOCATIONS
### Controller: ServiceableLocationsController
### Base route: /api/ServiceableLocations
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ─── 3.1 GET all active locations — happy path ──────────────────
### AllowAnonymous — public endpoint for delivery address selection
### Expected: 200 OK → array of ServiceableLocationDto

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ServiceableLocations HTTP/1.1

###

### ─── 3.2 GET location by ID — happy path ────────────────────────
### AllowAnonymous
### Expected: 200 OK → single ServiceableLocationDto

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ServiceableLocations/1 HTTP/1.1

###

### ─── 3.3 GET location by ID — not found ─────────────────────────
### Expected: 404 → { error: "Serviceable location not found" }

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ServiceableLocations/99999 HTTP/1.1

###

### ─── 3.4 GET search by pincode — happy path ─────────────────────
### AllowAnonymous
### Expected: 200 OK → filtered array (may be empty)

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ServiceableLocations/search/pincode/560001 HTTP/1.1

###

### ─── 3.5 GET search by pincode — no results ─────────────────────
### Expected: 200 OK → empty array []

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ServiceableLocations/search/pincode/000000 HTTP/1.1

###

### ─── 3.6 GET search by city ──────────────────────────────────────
### AllowAnonymous
### Expected: 200 OK → filtered array

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ServiceableLocations/search/city/Bangalore HTTP/1.1

###

### ─── 3.7 GET free-text search ────────────────────────────────────
### AllowAnonymous — frontend LocationService.searchServiceableLocations()
### Expected: 200 OK → filtered array

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ServiceableLocations/search?query=koramangala HTTP/1.1

###

### ─── 3.8 GET validate location ───────────────────────────────────
### AllowAnonymous — checks if location is serviceable
### Expected: 200 OK → ValidateAddressDto

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ServiceableLocations/validate/1 HTTP/1.1

###

### ─── 3.9 GET admin — all locations (including inactive) ─────────
### Admin only
### Expected: 200 OK → full list including IsActive=false

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ServiceableLocations/admin/all HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### ─── 3.10 GET admin/all — no auth ───────────────────────────────
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ServiceableLocations/admin/all HTTP/1.1

###


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 4. WALLET TRANSACTIONS
### Controller: WalletTransactionsController
### Base route: /api/WalletTransactions
###
### NOTE: All user endpoints use User.GetSovvaUserId() from JWT.
###       User must exist in user_auth_mapping (completed registration).
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ─── 4.1 GET my-balance — happy path ─────────────────────────────
### Authenticated user
### Expected: 200 OK → { balance: decimal, userId: int }

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/my-balance HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###

### ─── 4.2 GET my-balance — no auth ───────────────────────────────
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/my-balance HTTP/1.1

###

### ─── 4.3 GET my-transactions — happy path ───────────────────────
### Authenticated user
### Expected: 200 OK → array of WalletTransactionDto

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/my-transactions HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###

### ─── 4.4 GET my-transactions — no auth ──────────────────────────
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/my-transactions HTTP/1.1

###

### ─── 4.5 POST topup — happy path ─────────────────────────────────
### Authenticated user
### Expected: 200 OK → WalletTransactionDto
### DTO: WalletTopUpDto { amount (1-10000), description? }

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/topup HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": 500.00,
    "description": "Test top-up"
}

###

### ─── 4.6 POST topup — no auth ───────────────────────────────────
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/topup HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": 500.00
}

###

### ─── 4.7 POST topup — invalid: zero amount ──────────────────────
### Expected: 400 → { error: "Amount must be greater than 0" }

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/topup HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": 0
}

###

### ─── 4.8 POST topup — invalid: negative amount ──────────────────
### Expected: 400 → { error: "Amount must be greater than 0" }

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/topup HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": -100
}

###

### ─── 4.9 POST topup — invalid: exceeds max ──────────────────────
### Expected: 400 Bad Request (FluentValidation: Range 1-10000)

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/topup HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": 99999
}

###

### ─── 4.10 GET check-balance — happy path ─────────────────────────
### Authenticated user — checks if balance >= amount
### Expected: 200 OK → { hasSufficientBalance, currentBalance, requiredAmount, shortfall }

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/check-balance?amount=500 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###

### ─── 4.11 GET check-balance — no auth ───────────────────────────
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/check-balance?amount=500 HTTP/1.1

###

### ─── 4.12 GET check-balance — large amount (insufficient) ───────
### Expected: 200 OK → { hasSufficientBalance: false, shortfall: > 0 }

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/check-balance?amount=999999 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###

### ─── 4.13 GET check-balance — zero amount ───────────────────────
### Expected: 200 OK → { hasSufficientBalance: true, shortfall: 0 }

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/check-balance?amount=0 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 5. ADMIN WALLET ENDPOINTS
### Require Admin JWT
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ─── 5.1 GET admin/all — all transactions ───────────────────────
### Admin only
### Expected: 200 OK → array of WalletTransactionDto

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/admin/all HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### ─── 5.2 GET admin/all — no auth ────────────────────────────────
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/admin/all HTTP/1.1

###

### ─── 5.3 GET admin/all — user token (not admin) ─────────────────
### Expected: 403 Forbidden

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/admin/all HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###

### ─── 5.4 GET admin user balance ─────────────────────────────────
### Admin only — get specific user's balance
### Expected: 200 OK → { userId, balance }

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/admin/user/1/balance HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### ─── 5.5 POST admin credit user wallet ──────────────────────────
### Admin only — top up another user's wallet
### Expected: 200 OK → WalletTransactionDto

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/admin/user/1/credit HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": 100.00,
    "description": "Admin credit for testing"
}

###

### ─── 5.6 POST admin credit — invalid amount ─────────────────────
### Expected: 400 → { error: "Amount must be greater than 0" }

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/admin/user/1/credit HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": 0
}

###
